right away, and Matt Rice helped us get to who was our manager at the time, David Miner, all kind of toward the end and coming out of college, and that somehow led to us getting our Letterman material, we'd written some Conan in material, we'd written a Seinfeld, we'd written SNL ideas, but Letterman was hiring.
